jobs.objective:
Build the website for HAMLOCK - the hamster-powered time lock. One page, hosted on IPFS, site label hamlock. All copy in English.

THE CONTRACT IS ALREADY LIVE. Do not deploy anything. The site talks to it directly from the browser.
- Network: Ethereum Sepolia, chainId 11155111. Read through a public Sepolia RPC (for example https://ethereum-sepolia-rpc.publicnode.com) with a fallback RPC.
- Hamlock address: 0xc17b08994b70b468aa30e4e3d73edf9d65727302 (deployed in Sepolia block 12036187; scan events from that block).
- Source: https://github.com/identity-md-launches/launch-2793-build-hamlock-hamster-powered-time (src/Hamlock.sol).
- ABI to use:
  function lock(uint16 km) payable
  function open()
  function breakJar()
  function jars(address) view returns (uint128 amount, uint64 startWork, uint64 targetWork, uint64 deadline, uint16 km, uint256 rewardDebt)
  function pendingReward(address owner) view returns (uint256)
  function isOpenable(address owner) view returns (bool)
  function workRemaining(address owner) view returns (uint64)
  function currentWork() view returns (bool ok, uint64 cumulativeWork)
  function kmCompleted(address) view returns (uint256)
  function jarsCompleted(address) view returns (uint256)
  function jarsBroken(address) view returns (uint256)
