Visual polish and finishing only, at the highest quality you can deliver. Wheelings is a finished, working dapp on Sepolia (index.html with all CSS and JS inline, favicon.svg, og.png, card.png, README.md; the contracts/, release/ and dev/ folders are documentation only: do not build or run anything in dev/). It already has a moonlit night design: an illustrated hero with a turning wooden hamster wheel, a wooden pet frame, icon stat tiles, a glowing "Cheer now" button, medal ranks on the board, and a grass footer with a sleeping hamster. Keep that art direction and palette (navy night #0d1222, lantern gold #ffc861, ember #ff7a59, moss #7bd389, sky #7cc7ff, cream #f1ead9; Fraunces + Figtree + JetBrains Mono) and take it to the level of an award-winning indie game launch page.

Before any visual work, apply exactly these six code fixes in index.html (they fix the three advisories from your site content check). Replace each old text with the new text, character for character, and change nothing else in the script:

a) in loadStatus(), replace:
  const r = await fetch(API + '/v1/status', { cache: 'no-store' }); if (!r.ok) throw new Error('status');
  S.status = await r.json(); S.lastStatusAt = Date.now();
with:
  const ctl = new AbortController(); const to = setTimeout(() => ctl.abort(), 8000);
  try { const r = await fetch(API + '/v1/status', { cache: 'no-store', signal: ctl.signal }); if (!r.ok) throw new Error('status');
    S.status = await r.json(); S.lastStatusAt = Date.now(); } finally { clearTimeout(to); }

b) in boot(), replace:
  try { await loadStatus(); } catch { S.statusErr++; } render();
  try { S.deployed = await checkDeployed(); } catch { S.deployed = false; }
with:
  loadStatus().then(() => { S.statusErr = 0; }, () => { S.statusErr++; }).finally(render);   // never blocks startup
  try { S.deployed = await checkDeployed(); } catch { S.deployed = false; }
  S.checked = true;

c) in renderNow(), replace:
  $('notDeployed').hidden = S.deployed;
with:
  $('notDeployed').hidden = S.deployed || !S.checked;

d) in the S state object, replace:
art: new Map(),
with:
art: new Map(), artKey: new Map(), checked: false,

e) in loadBoard(), replace:
  for (const p of all.slice(0, 10)) await loadArt(p.id, false);
with:
  for (const p of all.slice(0, 10)) { const k = [p.xp, p.stage, p.mood, p.golden].join(':'); const grew = S.artKey.get(p.id) !== k; S.artKey.set(p.id, k); await loadArt(p.id, grew); }

f) in sendTx(), replace:
    const hash = await Wal.prov.request({ method: 'eth_sendTransaction', params: [{ from: Wal.addr, to: WHEELINGS, data, value: '0x0', gas: '0x' + gas.toString(16) }] });
with:
    let chainNow = null; try { chainNow = await Wal.prov.request({ method: 'eth_chainId' }); } catch {}
    if (String(chainNow).toLowerCase() !== SEPOLIA) { toast('The wallet left Sepolia. Switch back to Sepolia and try again.'); return null; }
    const hash = await Wal.prov.request({ method: 'eth_sendTransaction', params: [{ from: Wal.addr, to: WHEELINGS, data, value: '0x0', gas: '0x' + gas.toString(16), chainId: SEPOLIA }] });

