2. Add a new static section "Stages" right after "The wheel right now": five illustrated cards in a row (wrapping on phones) for Egg (0 XP), Pup (first XP), Runner (5,000 XP, headband), Champion (20,000 XP, green cape), Legend (60,000 XP, crown), drawn in inline SVG in the same cute hamster style, with a small line under each. Below it a small legend of the three moods: Happy, Hungry (no cheer for a day), Sleepy (three days), and a note that Squeek NFT holders get a golden collar.
3. Pet frame (#petArt): add carved wood details (nails, grain), a soft warm lantern glow behind it, and a celebratory burst of sparkles and tiny stars when the element gets the class "cheering". The pet image is an SVG served by the smart contract: show it exactly as-is.
4. Polish every panel: consistent spacing rhythm, refined typography scale, subtle glass highlights, smooth hover and focus states, a gentle entrance animation when sections first appear (sections must stay visible even if animations are off), and a nicer toast (#toast) with an icon.
5. Leaderboard (#board): keep the medals; add a faint podium glow behind the top row, nicer column alignment, and a tidy mobile layout (no clipped text; the table may scroll horizontally inside its own box).
6. Replace og.png (1200x630) with a rich illustrated version of the hero scene with the title "Wheelings" (gold "ings") and the line "On-chain pets that grow on Squeektoshi's real wheel". Set og:image and twitter:image to the real https URL of /og.png on this site. Also update favicon.svg to a crisp hamster-in-wheel icon.

